Cell["R3. Completeness, relative to independent tests", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"69a1dd67-bddc-4e46-9a69-2d37764c979f"],

Cell["\<\
Theorem. If no two ifs read related tests and no success return is inside a \
loop, then for every body: mayOk is True exactly when the body can succeed, \
and R is exactly the set of necessary literals.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"ce19f6a9-e939-4ada-8476-e01513546c6d"],

Cell["\<\
Proof, by the same induction as round 00, with the invariant strengthened \
from \[SubsetEqual] to =. Write Impl(f) for the literals f implies. Two \
lemmas carry every clause. L1: a literal follows from X or Y exactly when it \
follows from both, so Impl(X \[Or] Y) = Impl(X) \[Intersection] Impl(Y). L2: \
if t occurs nowhere in a satisfiable X, then Impl(t \[And] X) = {t} \[Union] \
Impl(X), because any assignment satisfying X can be extended with t = True. \
For an if, the success condition is (t \[And] A) \[Or] (\[Not]t \[And] B): by \
L1 and L2 its literals are Impl(A) \[Intersection] Impl(B) when both branches \
can succeed (t and \[Not]t cancel), {\[Not]t} \[Union] Impl(B) when only B \
can, and symmetrically. These are the analysis' three if rules. A loop with \
no success return inside has condition (c \[And] A) \[Or] (\[Not]c \[And] k) \
with A \[DoubleLongRightArrow] k (round 00's lemma), so its if literals are \
Impl(k): the analysis passes the continuation through. A loop with a success \
return inside is where the theorem stops: the analysis returns nothing, while \
the loop's own guards may be necessary.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"16f271d4-91a9-4e2d-b70d-a61a1204d877"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"tbl", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"\"\<obligation\>\"", ",", "\"\<checked as\>\"", 
     ",", "\"\<result\>\""}], "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<L1: Impl(X \[Or] Y) = Impl(X) \[Intersection] Impl(Y)\>\"",
        ",", "\"\<propositional tautology\>\"", ",", 
       RowBox[{"mark", "[", 
        RowBox[{"TautologyQ", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"x", "||", "y"}], "\[Implies]", "l"}], ")"}], "\[Equivalent]", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"(", 
             RowBox[{"x", "\[Implies]", "l"}], ")"}], "&&", 
            RowBox[{"(", 
             RowBox[{"y", "\[Implies]", "l"}], ")"}]}]}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"x", ",", "y", ",", "l"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], 
     ",", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<L2: Impl(t \[And] X) = {t} \[Union] Impl(X), t fresh\>\"", 
       ",", "\"\<every satisfiable X of two variables, every literal\>\"", ",", 
       RowBox[{"mark", "[", 
        RowBox[{"AllTrue", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Select", "[", 
           RowBox[{"U", ",", "SatisfiableQ"}], "]"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"ex", "[", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"t", "&&", "#1"}], ",", 
              RowBox[{"litsOf", "[", 
               RowBox[{"{", 
                RowBox[{"a", ",", "b", ",", "t"}], "}"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], "===", 
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{"True", ",", 
              RowBox[{"Sort", "[", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"ex", "[", 
                  RowBox[{"#1", ",", 
                   RowBox[{"litsOf", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"a", ",", "b"}], "}"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], "\[LeftDoubleBracket]",
                  "2", "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], "\[Union]", 
                RowBox[{"{", "t", "}"}]}], "]"}]}], "}"}]}], "&"}]}], "]"}], 
        "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<if rule = exact literals of (t \[And] A) \[Or] (\[Not]t \
\[And] B)\>\"", ",", "\"\<every pair A, B of two-variable functions (256)\>\"",
        ",", 
       RowBox[{"mark", "[", 
        RowBox[{"AllTrue", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Tuples", "[", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"U", ",", "U"}], "}"}], "]"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"ifRule", "[", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"ex", "[", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{
                "#1", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "1", "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], 
                ",", 
                RowBox[{"litsOf", "[", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                  RowBox[{"a", ",", "b"}], "}"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
              RowBox[{"ex", "[", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{
                "#1", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "2", "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], 
                ",", 
                RowBox[{"litsOf", "[", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                  RowBox[{"a", ",", "b"}], "}"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}], "===", 
            RowBox[{"ex", "[", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"(", 
                RowBox[{"t", "&&", 
                 RowBox[{
                 "#1", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "1", 
                  "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}], ")"}], "||", 
               RowBox[{"(", 
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"!", "t"}], "&&", 
                 RowBox[{
                 "#1", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "2", 
                  "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}], ")"}]}], ",", 
              RowBox[{"litsOf", "[", 
               RowBox[{"{", 
                RowBox[{"a", ",", "b", ",", "t"}], "}"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], 
           "&"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<loop rule = exact if literals of (c \[And] A) \[Or] \
(\[Not]c \[And] k), A \[DoubleLongRightArrow] k\>\"", 
       ",", "\"\<every such pair A, k\>\"", ",", 
       RowBox[{"mark", "[", 
        RowBox[{"AllTrue", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Select", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"Tuples", "[", 
             RowBox[{"{", 
              RowBox[{"U", ",", "U"}], "}"}], "]"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"TautologyQ", "[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{
                "#1", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "1", "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], 
                "\[Implies]", 
                RowBox[{
                "#1", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "2", 
                 "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}], ",", 
               RowBox[{"{", 
                RowBox[{"a", ",", "b"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], "&"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
          
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"ex", "[", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{
              "#1", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "2", "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], ",", 
              RowBox[{"litsOf", "[", 
               RowBox[{"{", 
                RowBox[{"a", ",", "b"}], "}"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], "===", 
            RowBox[{"ex", "[", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"(", 
                RowBox[{"cc", "&&", 
                 RowBox[{
                 "#1", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "1", 
                  "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}], ")"}], "||", 
               RowBox[{"(", 
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"!", "cc"}], "&&", 
                 RowBox[{
                 "#1", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "2", 
                  "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}], ")"}]}], ",", 
              RowBox[{"litsOf", "[", 
               RowBox[{"{", 
                RowBox[{"a", ",", "b"}], "}"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "&"}]}], 
         "]"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<return state, return False, effect\>\"", 
       ",", "\"\<f = True, False, k\>\"", ",", "\"\<immediate\>\""}], "}"}]}],
     "}"}]}], "]"}]], "Input",ExpressionUUID->"847ad014-8dba-439a-a2fc-\
7ecddbb43aa3"],

