Cell["\<\
L1 is proved by TautologyQ. L2 and the two rules are proved by hand above; \
the rows check them over a finite universe as a guard against a slip in the \
argument. Exhaustive check on the programs themselves, with each if's test \
replaced by its own fresh variable (independence), against the literals the \
success condition implies:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"696a8cdf-e6e6-4301-a5b1-595b40e34acc"],

